cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use openfe-api in published work, please cite it along with OpenFE.
title: "openfe-api: an API for running OpenFE free energy experiments on HPC and server VMs"
abstract: >-
  Runs OpenFE absolute, relative and separated-topologies binding free energy calculations,
  and plain molecular dynamics, from protein-ligand structures on a Slurm cluster or a server
  VM, as a Python library, a command line tool, or an HTTP service.
type: software
authors:
